  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.13.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 👷 ci(codeql): scan local inputs and guard activation templates by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3317\n* 👷 ci(codeql): add regression queries for 21.7 advisories by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3318\n* 👷 ci(upgrade): pass base to create-pull-request by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3320\n* 👷 ci(upgrade): dispatch CI on the upgrade pull request by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3322\n* Upgrade embedded pip/setuptools/wheel and CI test tools by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3321\n* docs: correct changelog fragment types by @januththedev in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3324\n* 🐛 fix(activation): escape PowerShell curly single quotes by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3325\n* 👷 ci(codeql): scan the tasks scripts by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3327\n* 👷 ci(check): gate required checks behind one job by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3328\n* 🐛 fix(activation): stop bash re-expanding the prompt in PS1 by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3326\n* 🔧 build(docs): pin Mermaid and bump it weekly by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3333\n* 🔧 build(meta): add Changelog and Funding project URLs by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3334\n* 📝 docs(release): refresh release verification docs by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3330\n* 👷 ci(upgrade): bump the GraalPy test version weekly by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3332\n* 👷 ci(deps): review dependency licenses and advisories on pull requests by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3329\n\n## New Contributors\n* @januththedev made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3324\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.12.1...21.13.0",
